<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Gateway raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Gateway raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Dean Witter upgraded Gateway 2000 Inc to buy from accumulate, according to a Dean Witter source.</p>
<p>-- shares jumped two to 56-1/8.</p>
</text>
